          "Lead with fiscal discipline and service quality as core messaging: a $160,717-income, 57.3% college-educated, 91.4% homeowner constituency expects government to deliver measurable results on school funding, infrastructure, and public safety without waste or mismanagement. This is not an ideological electorate; it is a results-oriented one.",
