          "Consolidate affluent professional and business-owning constituencies on economic growth, tax stability, and property-value protection while simultaneously addressing the specific quality-of-life and environmental concerns of the educated, younger segment of that base—a 35.0 median age in a 76% Republican district indicates young professionals evaluating on concrete delivery, not inherited partisan loyalty.",
          "Prevent Democratic consolidation of the current 24% base by understanding specifically what is driving that opposition in an affluent, educated, homeowner-dominant district—whether environmental regulation, education funding priorities, or other governance failures—and offer concrete remedies rather than assuming the margin is stable.",
