          "Lead with housing affordability and wage pressure for renters and young adults — at 56.1% renter rate and 28.8 median age, this is the material economic security issue for a majority of the district. Concrete policy on housing supply, zoning, landlord-tenant balance, and wages in a high cost-of-living market is the foundation for authentic engagement with the constituency that nearly gave you a loss in 2024.",
